  "details": "Version:\nVRChat 2020.3.3, build 992\nDescription of the bug:\nVRC_Sync Video Stream's auto start does not work.\nWhen I place a VRC_Sync Video Stream in our world with the Auto Start checkbox turned on, it does not start playing automatically.\nThis is occurring since VRChat 2020.3.3, build 992.\nWhen I check the log, youtube-dl is working, but then the playback log does not appear. Now I have to send a manual Play or Next RPC to start the playback.",
